# 默认排除根目录下的所有文件、文件夹和点文件夹。
/*

# 保留规则文件本身。
!.gitignore

# 仅同步基准版本中 Skill 文件夹
!behavioral-modes/
!behavioral-modes/**
!brooks-audit/
!brooks-audit/**
!brooks-debt/
!brooks-debt/**
!brooks-health/
!brooks-health/**
!brooks-review/
!brooks-review/**
!brooks-sweep/
!brooks-sweep/**
!brooks-test/
!brooks-test/**
!_shared
!_shared/**
!chrome/
!chrome/**
!clean-code/
!clean-code/**
!codegraph-code/
!codegraph-code/**
!code-review-checklist/
!code-review-checklist/**
!code-rules/
!code-rules/**
!find-skills/
!find-skills/**
!full-output-enforcement/
!full-output-enforcement/**
!geo-fundamentals/
!geo-fundamentals/**
!gog/
!gog/**
!handoff-writer/
!handoff-writer/**
!openai-whisper/
!openai-whisper/**
!plan-writing/
!plan-writing/**
!proxy-service-probe/
!proxy-service-probe/**
!receiving-code-review/
!receiving-code-review/**
!seo-fundamentals/
!seo-fundamentals/**
!skill-creator/
!skill-creator/**
!skill-vetter/
!skill-vetter/**
!srt-subtitle-translator/
!srt-subtitle-translator/**
!verification-before-completion/
!verification-before-completion/**
!visual-design/
!visual-design/**
!window-screenshot/
!window-screenshot/**

# Python test and tool caches are local artifacts.
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# 字幕技能的本地测试产物，忽略规则统一维护在仓库根目录。
/srt-subtitle-translator/**/.coverage
/srt-subtitle-translator/**/htmlcov/

# 排除所有文件夹内的“.”文件夹及其内容
.*/

# 全局排除任意层级下的“_temp”目录及其全部内容（含子目录）
# 该规则必须放在所有“!”保留规则之后，否则会被覆盖
_temp/

# 本地私密配置文件及凭据（必须置于保留规则之后）
fofa_config.json
**/fofa_config.json
*.env
*.env.*
!*.env.example
